00:30:31.584 --> 00:30:33.452
There is no one here.

00:30:34.412 --> 00:30:35.787
You're overthinking.

00:30:38.039 --> 00:30:40.063
What's wrong with just bringing my boyfriend home?

00:30:41.489 --> 00:30:42.289
You sure?

00:30:44.529 --> 00:30:45.796
Let's have some cake.

00:30:45.976 --> 00:30:47.076
Have a seat.

00:31:09.828 --> 00:31:10.628
Fuse.

00:31:12.302 --> 00:31:13.602
I brought you some water.

00:31:16.643 --> 00:31:20.314
Jeen, why are you dressing like this?

00:31:25.148 --> 00:31:27.310
Well, it's hot.

00:31:28.868 --> 00:31:32.291
Fuse, can you take off my necklace?

00:31:32.504 --> 00:31:34.481
I'm afraid it'll get cake on it.

00:31:44.668 --> 00:31:45.702
Why don't you turn around?

00:31:46.901 --> 00:31:47.701
This position is fine.

00:31:52.423 --> 00:31:53.303
Hurry up.

00:32:02.468 --> 00:32:04.602
Shall we do something to celebrate our anniversary?

00:32:07.581 --> 00:32:08.470
Tonight...

00:32:10.194 --> 00:32:11.848
Let's stay together until the morning.

00:32:45.647 --> 00:32:48.581
That's Tea, my brother.

00:32:49.669 --> 00:32:51.735
I forgot that she has a brother.

00:32:52.015 --> 00:32:53.360
They look nothing alike.

00:32:54.602 --> 00:32:55.402
Oh.

00:33:01.347 --> 00:33:04.670
No, Fuse. I can explain.

00:33:05.416 --> 00:33:06.861
It's not what you think.

00:33:07.912 --> 00:33:08.738
Fuse.

00:33:09.278 --> 00:33:10.382
Fuse.

00:34:13.095 --> 00:34:13.895
What's wrong with you?

00:34:14.354 --> 00:34:15.343
What's wrong with you?

00:34:15.576 --> 00:34:16.521
You...

00:34:16.802 --> 00:34:17.902
You tell me first.

00:34:18.108 --> 00:34:20.941
You first, mine is not that big deal.

00:34:21.281 --> 00:34:22.814
But yours is probably a big deal, right?

00:34:33.074 --> 00:34:35.941
Damn. That's so wild.

00:34:46.188 --> 00:34:48.622
Are you sure that you didn't get it wrong?

00:34:49.014 --> 00:34:53.148
Yeah, she hasn't texted me yet.

00:34:55.368 --> 00:34:56.702
That's so weird.

00:35:02.735 --> 00:35:06.568
How can I tell which one is real?

00:35:30.014 --> 00:35:31.263
Hey.

00:35:47.095 --> 00:35:48.076
Hey.

00:35:48.101 --> 00:35:48.812
Ouch.

00:35:48.837 --> 00:35:49.442
What?

00:35:58.257 --> 00:35:59.057
So what?

00:36:00.090 --> 00:36:01.490
I did some digging.

00:36:01.730 --> 00:36:02.597
His name is France.

00:36:02.797 --> 00:36:03.797
Not Tea.

00:36:04.057 --> 00:36:05.324
He is our age.

00:36:05.543 --> 00:36:07.143
And he definitely has no siblings.

00:36:08.990 --> 00:36:10.257
Wow, Est.

00:36:10.723 --> 00:36:11.557
You...

00:36:12.424 --> 00:36:13.642
You're so nosy.

00:36:13.642 --> 00:36:14.324
Come on.

00:36:15.544 --> 00:36:16.344
I knew it.

00:36:17.024 --> 00:36:18.490
When I saw them myself,

00:36:18.657 --> 00:36:20.224
they're sitting so close as if were glued together.

00:36:20.390 --> 00:36:21.457
My friends also told me that...

00:36:21.857 --> 00:36:23.657
he hooks up with people nearly every school.

00:36:24.657 --> 00:36:27.124
This guy texts all beautiful girls.

00:36:28.090 --> 00:36:31.024
So, this means Jeen got played too.

00:36:31.236 --> 00:36:32.036
Ugh.

00:36:32.790 --> 00:36:34.324
Do you still care about her?

00:36:46.657 --> 00:36:47.457
Whoa.

00:36:47.690 --> 00:36:49.024
How could he do such things?

00:36:49.990 --> 00:36:50.790
Right.

00:36:51.224 --> 00:36:52.290
Listen up.

00:36:52.990 --> 00:36:54.624
Whatever she does to you,

00:36:55.190 --> 00:36:57.290
she'll get it back the same way.

00:36:57.924 --> 00:36:58.924
Take it easy.

00:36:59.956 --> 00:37:00.756
Smile.

00:37:01.675 --> 00:37:03.362
Great.

00:37:04.890 --> 00:37:05.724
Hey, guys.

00:37:06.833 --> 00:37:07.799
I want to play that one.

00:37:07.824 --> 00:37:08.690
Okay, let's play.

00:37:09.057 --> 00:37:10.124
Come on.

00:37:10.890 --> 00:37:12.090
Hey, count me in.

00:37:12.290 --> 00:37:13.290
Hold on.

00:37:13.690 --> 00:37:14.624
Wait for me.

00:37:22.779 --> 00:37:23.913
You're good at defense.

00:37:27.413 --> 00:37:28.813
Hey, Fuse.

00:37:29.513 --> 00:37:30.313
Hey.

00:37:31.313 --> 00:37:32.146
What brings you here?

00:37:33.279 --> 00:37:34.413
Est called me.

00:37:35.113 --> 00:37:35.913
What about you?

00:37:36.879 --> 00:37:38.613
I'm here to pick up him after tutoring class.

00:37:39.313 --> 00:37:40.113
Right?

00:37:42.579 --> 00:37:44.013
Did you get any scores?

00:37:44.213 --> 00:37:45.313
Hey, I did.

00:37:45.746 --> 00:37:46.879
Did you score some goals, Fuse?

00:37:47.679 --> 00:37:48.513
I didn't.

00:37:49.079 --> 00:37:50.013
I've already exchanged it.

00:38:04.913 --> 00:38:06.320
I invited him along.

00:38:06.859 --> 00:38:08.009
He's at the same tutoring place with Book.

00:38:12.479 --> 00:38:14.413
Tee, you should play it.

00:38:14.746 --> 00:38:15.746
You must score some goals.

00:38:17.213 --> 00:38:18.143
That's easy.

00:38:18.143 --> 00:38:18.813
Go ahead, dude.

00:38:23.946 --> 00:38:25.079
Nice strike.

00:38:29.346 --> 00:38:30.579
Why don't you play it, Frame?

00:38:41.746 --> 00:38:44.379
I bought you a beverage. It's good.

00:38:45.313 --> 00:38:46.113
How much is it?

00:38:47.179 --> 00:38:47.979
It's fine.

00:38:51.119 --> 00:38:53.486
Well, I'll treat you some snacks later.

00:38:54.506 --> 00:38:55.306
Great.

00:38:55.813 --> 00:38:56.613
Wanna play?

00:38:57.579 --> 00:38:58.379
Of course.

00:38:58.579 --> 00:38:59.946
Do you know how to play? I"ll teach you.

00:39:00.092 --> 00:39:01.659
I don't know, teach me.

00:39:02.579 --> 00:39:03.613
This couple too?

00:39:05.679 --> 00:39:06.479
I have no idea.

00:39:07.613 --> 00:39:09.079
Aren't you close to Tee?

00:39:09.913 --> 00:39:10.779
I really have no idea.

00:39:41.212 --> 00:39:41.881
Fuse.

00:39:42.168 --> 00:39:43.865
Frame.

00:39:44.213 --> 00:39:45.479
Let him sleep.

00:39:45.946 --> 00:39:48.179
He told me he didn't get any sleep last night.

00:39:50.146 --> 00:39:51.513
(Frame) Shall we leave now?

00:39:53.313 --> 00:39:54.113
(Book) It's up to you.

00:39:57.014 --> 00:39:57.913
(Frame) What should I do?

00:39:58.879 --> 00:39:59.813
(Frame) Do you want to go back now?

00:40:01.379 --> 00:40:03.913
(Book) You decide. I'm fine with going back.

00:40:08.413 --> 00:40:11.313
Hey, I'm leaving. I have to take Book home.

00:40:11.513 --> 00:40:13.479
I'll go with you. My mom told me to go home.

00:40:13.546 --> 00:40:14.912
Me too. Let's go.

00:40:15.225 --> 00:40:16.891
-Okay, you guys can leave.
-See you.

00:40:16.979 --> 00:40:17.913
I'll look after Fuse.

00:40:18.989 --> 00:40:19.659
-Bye.
-See you.

00:40:19.711 --> 00:40:21.241
See you.

00:40:21.962 --> 00:40:22.462
Let's go.

00:40:22.681 --> 00:40:23.596
Come on.

00:40:23.790 --> 00:40:24.610
Which way? Turn right?

00:40:27.813 --> 00:40:30.313
Lookmo, can I talk to you for a minute?

00:40:35.299 --> 00:40:40.266
Tee, can you look after him for me?
I'll be back soon.

00:40:48.951 --> 00:40:49.785
What's your problem?

00:40:50.051 --> 00:40:51.351
Why are you making that face?

00:40:55.418 --> 00:40:56.787
What are you mad at?

00:40:57.013 --> 00:40:59.711
I should be the one who is mad
since you didn't come yesterday.

00:41:00.231 --> 00:41:03.263
Why are you mad?
You already had company.

00:41:03.617 --> 00:41:06.817
Since you didn't come,
so I brought a friend to dance instead.

00:41:08.311 --> 00:41:09.311
Are you sure he's just friends?

00:41:11.992 --> 00:41:12.792
Kris.

00:41:12.944 --> 00:41:13.744
Kris.

00:41:14.998 --> 00:41:16.565
That's a badass name.

00:41:25.551 --> 00:41:27.785
That is my friend, Kristina.

00:41:28.905 --> 00:41:30.571
Hi, darling.

00:41:32.764 --> 00:41:34.264
Are you over it yet?

00:41:35.351 --> 00:41:36.738
I also wanted to dance with you...

00:41:36.818 --> 00:41:37.918
but you couldn't come.

00:41:39.984 --> 00:41:40.884
That's all I want to say.

00:41:41.185 --> 00:41:41.779
I'm off.

00:41:41.805 --> 00:41:42.477
Hold on.

00:41:46.224 --> 00:41:47.291
Wanna grab some food?

00:41:47.824 --> 00:41:49.158
My treat. Let me make it up to you.

00:41:50.998 --> 00:41:51.870
And...

00:41:53.244 --> 00:41:54.844
I want to have dinner with you as well.

00:42:07.332 --> 00:42:09.641
Hello? Lookmo?

00:42:10.354 --> 00:42:14.031
He's still sleeping.
You want me to take him home?

00:42:16.151 --> 00:42:16.951
What about you?

00:42:18.218 --> 00:42:19.018
Ah.

00:42:20.618 --> 00:42:21.951
I'll take him home instead.

00:42:23.385 --> 00:42:24.185
Okay.

00:42:28.951 --> 00:42:30.851
Lookmo told me to take Fuse home.

00:42:33.618 --> 00:42:36.218
So we have to wait until he wakes up then.

00:42:39.285 --> 00:42:42.451
If I fell asleep like Fuse, would you look after me?

00:42:43.051 --> 00:42:44.851
Of course, we're friends.

00:42:48.124 --> 00:42:50.424
So, am I just a freind to you?

00:42:55.185 --> 00:42:56.885
Is there still any hope for me?

00:43:10.048 --> 00:43:10.707
Sys.

00:43:16.125 --> 00:43:17.291
Don't put your hope in me.

00:43:22.251 --> 00:43:23.785
It's not that you're not good,

00:43:25.151 --> 00:43:26.851
but I'm just not ready to be with anyone.

00:43:27.885 --> 00:43:28.685
I'm sorry.

00:43:33.351 --> 00:43:34.418
Are you not ready?

00:43:34.718 --> 00:43:37.118
Or do you already have someone in your mind?

00:43:48.651 --> 00:43:52.451
Even though he keeps hurting you,
you still don't think about walking away?

00:43:57.051 --> 00:43:59.385
Love is nonsense.

00:44:00.098 --> 00:44:01.298
I'd better go.

00:44:02.225 --> 00:44:03.091
Get home safely.

00:44:11.410 --> 00:44:12.210
Oh!

00:44:37.001 --> 00:44:38.401
How are you doing?

00:44:38.974 --> 00:44:42.641
I told you I'm not you because I love you.

00:44:43.372 --> 00:44:44.503
Between Tee and you,

00:44:45.078 --> 00:44:46.548
I don't know what's going on.

00:44:47.198 --> 00:44:49.695
But if you can only see him as a friend,
you should step back.

00:44:51.321 --> 00:44:52.090
Tee.

00:44:53.327 --> 00:44:54.930
Please don't get over me yet.

00:44:55.857 --> 00:44:57.486
Can I have a little more time?

00:44:59.662 --> 00:45:01.723
And I'll never break your heart again.